	(text "Charging input: two pogo pads, ST OCVPB21-13F6, to the charger" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.0 18.0 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "695712ab-51f0-4cfd-aca2-9af48a65b684"))
	(text "The bridge accepts either polarity. Input 4.25-5.55 V. OUT_5V needs >= 10 uF. FLAG is open drain with 100 kOhm pull-up." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.0 25.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6cf5f92a-b2da-4e46-90e5-e442a1b24f17"))
	(text "RLIM sets the current limit: ILIM = (318 - RLIM) / 0.447 mA. 180 Ohm gives about 310 mA." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.0 29.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2f7da860-a8cf-474f-a7f6-da401f90a85a"))
	(text "Operating temperature of this part: -30 to +65 degC. Data pins are not used (two-pad pogo)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.0 34.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7e47c7a9-0384-4e1e-9aa0-0cf29cde692d"))
